The current folder contains a project with user interface designed to control a quantum optics
experiment. The project is written in Python using Dash package. It is structured as follows.

The main page layout is defined in app.py file. The app uses a Quart server for websockets that
transmit data, and a Flask server to handle the frontend. Both are defined in the file server.py.
The Quart server is served using hypercorn, and the Flask server is served in cherrypy, both of
which are started using run.py file. The app consists of multiple pages, which are defined in the folder
pages. The folder components contains code with description of Dash AIO (All-in-one) components, which
are just an assembly of elementary components, and are used for convenience. The code for controlling
hardware is in the folder controllers. The objects used for interfacing with hardware are initialized
in the file devices.py in the root folder. This should be everything you need.

